Delete on a140_ord
  InitPlan 2
    ->  Result
          InitPlan 1
            ->  Limit
                  ->  Index Only Scan using a140_ord_pkey on a140_ord a140_ord_1
  ->  Index Scan using a140_ord_pkey on a140_ord
        Index Cond: (o_orderkey = (InitPlan 2).col1)
